    {
      "id": "qn026",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 561,
      "width": 402,
      "height": 192.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1092927638,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1700775852,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795550556216,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each step:  +1 or −1,  equally likely.\n\nKey results:\n  E  [position at t]  =  0\n  Var[position at t]  =  t\n  Std[position at t]  =  √t\n\nWalk spreads out as √t, not t.\nExpected value stays at zero.\n\nBasis for modelling stock prices.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each step:  +1 or −1,  equally likely.\n\nKey results:\n  E  [position at t]  =  0\n  Var[position at t]  =  t\n  Std[position at t]  =  √t\n\nWalk spreads out as √t, not t.\nExpected value stays at zero.\n\nBasis for modelling stock prices.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
