    {
      "id": "qn034",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1074,
      "y": 561,
      "width": 402,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e64980",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 111644477,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 449327746,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795550556216,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Geometric Brownian Motion (GBM):\n\nS(t+dt) = S(t) · exp(\n   (μ − σ²/2)·dt + σ·√dt·Z )\n\n  μ  = drift  (e.g. 12 % annual)\n  σ  = vol    (e.g. 18 % annual)\n  Z  ~ N(0,1) random shock\n\nLog-returns are normal. S > 0 always.\n\nSquare-root-of-time rule:\n  σ_annual = σ_daily × √250\n\n  σ_daily = 1 %  →  σ_annual ≈ 15.8 %\n  σ_daily = 3 %  →  σ_annual ≈ 47.4 %\n\nFollows directly from Var(t) = t.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Geometric Brownian Motion (GBM):\n\nS(t+dt) = S(t) · exp(\n   (μ − σ²/2)·dt + σ·√dt·Z )\n\n  μ  = drift  (e.g. 12 % annual)\n  σ  = vol    (e.g. 18 % annual)\n  Z  ~ N(0,1) random shock\n\nLog-returns are normal. S > 0 always.\n\nSquare-root-of-time rule:\n  σ_annual = σ_daily × √250\n\n  σ_daily = 1 %  →  σ_annual ≈ 15.8 %\n  σ_daily = 3 %  →  σ_annual ≈ 47.4 %\n\nFollows directly from Var(t) = t.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
